==Overview ==
'''1x1x1x1''' was an [[IamEvan (Enemy)|enemy]] that would spawn after the final wave in the [[Crossroads]] [[Maps|map]]. The wave will say ‘[[Evil Wave|evil wave]]’ but there will sadly not be a reward of 1,000 [[Coins|coins]]. The wave shows a cutscene of the 1x1x1x1 turning into [[Classic 1x1x1x1]] and holding a Tix. (Confusing) '''1x1x1x1'''  is weak, being able to kill him with a few shots.

==Appearance==
The 1x1x1x1 is an entity with transparent body, you can see his bone through his body. He looks angry and wears a domino. He has pitch black skin and a green torso.

==Strategy==
This [[Enemies|enemy]] does not have high health, so the easiest method is to use [[Classic Cameraman]]. 
You can also use [[Mythic|Mythics]] or [[Godly|Godlies]]. [[Clock Spider]] can also be very useful because of the high damage.

== Trivia ==

* People used to think that 1x1x1x1 was a hacker, but Roblox soon debunked this theory.
* 1x1x1x1 was the main character of The Roblox Classic event.
* 1x1x1x1 can only appear on [[Crossroads]].
* You can 3 shot him with 15 maxed out [[Classic Cameraman]].
* He used to be easy to kill, and is one of the most weakest bosses in the game.
* He used to come on any gamemode.
* He was about 2.3 times weaker than the [[Classic 1x1x1x1]].

